# RAFEEQ — the scheduler
#
# ⚠️ Without this line, FOUR things silently stop:
#
#   commutes:generate-trips    daily   — bookable days stop being created, so a
#                                        commute quietly becomes unbookable about a
#                                        month after it was published
#   memberships:roll-forward   daily   — recurring members stop being seated
#   trips:flush-locations      30s     — every GPS trail is lost (buffers expire
#                                        after an hour), so a no-show dispute has no
#                                        evidence
#   trips:purge-locations      daily   — the 90-day retention promise is not kept
#
# None of them reports an error. Install with `sudo crontab -u www-data -e`:

* * * * * cd /var/www/rafeeq && /usr/bin/php artisan schedule:run >> /dev/null 2>&1
